  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "いきのあった　コンビネーションですの　ざいりょうに　なりそうなものをまえばで　きりだして　はこびさる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "호흡이 척척 맞는 콤비네이션으로 집의 재료가 될 만한 것을 앞니로 잘라 내어 가지고 간다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會以絕佳的團隊合作，把能當成巢穴建材的東西用門牙切斷後搬走。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ces Pokémon travaillent en équipe. À l’aide de leur incisive, ils extraient les matériaux nécessaires pour construire leur nid, puis ils les emportent.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Zwieps arbeiten perfekt im Team zusammen. Sie nagen mit den Vorderzähnen Material für den Nestbau ab und tragen es dann davon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando encuentran un material que les parece útil para su nido, lo recortan con sus incisivos y lo acarrean, todo en perfecta compenetración.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sono una coppia molto affiatata. Se trovano del materiale utile per la loro tana, lo ritagliano con gli incisivi e lo portano via.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Exhibiting great teamwork, they use their incisors to cut pieces out of any material that might be useful for a nest, then make off with them.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "息の合った　コンビネーションで巣の　材料に　なりそうなものを前歯で　切り出して　運び去る。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "凭借默契十足的团队合作，用门牙切断能当作巢穴的材料的东西，并将其搬走。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando encuentran un material que les parece útil para su nido, lo recortan con sus incisivos y lo acarrean, todo en perfecta compenetración.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "どんなときでも　２ひきは　いっしょ。みつけた　エサは　ぴったりとはんぶんこして　なかよく　たべる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "언제나 두 마리가 함께한다. 발견한 먹이는 정확히 반으로 나눠서 사이좋게 먹는다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "無論何時２隻都待在一起。會把尋獲的食物均分成兩半，親密無間地一同進食。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ces Pokémon vont toujours par paire. Lorsqu’ils trouvent de la nourriture, ils la divisent en deux parts égales avant de la déguster.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Die beiden sind unzertrennlich. Finden sie Futter, teilen sie dieses in zwei identische Hälften, ehe sie es zu fressen beginnen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Siempre van en pareja. Cuando encuentran comida, la dividen en dos partes idénticas para compartirla.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si muovono in coppia in ogni circostanza. Se trovano del cibo, lo dividono esattamente a metà e lo mangiano tutti contenti.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The pair sticks together no matter what. They split any food they find exactly in half and then eat it together.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "どんなときでも　２匹は　一緒。見つけた　エサは　ぴったりと半分こして　仲良く　食べる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "无论何时２只待都在一起。会把寻获的食物均分成两半，亲密无间地一起进食。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Siempre van en pareja. Cuando encuentran comida, la dividen en dos partes idénticas para compartirla.",
